**The Ten-Year Account**

The full record does not produce a clean villain. It produces something more honest and more difficult: two people whose genuine love for each other created a closed system that both of them failed to maintain with the honesty it required. The failure was not equal — Annie's in the terminal phase was more sustained and more directly harmful. But the path to that failure ran through:

Mutual addiction from early in the relationship. A financial architecture that oscillated and generated grievances neither party acknowledged in full historical context. A consensual sexual framework that was real but that the Eli infidelity broke at its structural foundation. A forced relocation that destroyed the conditions for repair at the moment repair was most needed. A re-settlement in which the dependency simply inverted.

Annie sent 'YOU ARE MY EVERYTHING' in all-caps on November 29, 2015. She sent 'What the hell Dan' in response to 'I am going to fucking kill myself' on March 1, 2026. Those are the same person. The question is not which one was real. Both were real. The question is what happened between them.

The answer is 126,683 messages. The answer is ten years. The answer is that neither party found a way to be honest with the other at the moments when honesty was the only thing that could have changed the trajectory.

The exit was never through the verdict. It was through the door. As of March 16, 2026, he had not used it.

